        }
      ],
      "returnType": "TSharedRef<ObjectType,ESPMode::ThreadSafe>",
      "docs": "Acquire a shared object from the pool.\nShared objects do not need to be returned to the pool. They'll be\nreclaimed automatically when their reference count goes to zero.\n@return The shared object.\n@see Acquire, AcquireUnique, Reset, ToShared"
    },
